igned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\cdot 2t+(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t))\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337177 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337178 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337179 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337180 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337181 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1041 "selection" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337180 13194139535201 true] [17592186337176 1110 #uuid "47b4081b-0b01-5827-b2f4-2384eb0560b6" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337177 1034 "{t}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)-t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2})" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337177 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337177 1111 #uuid "87961b16-93f3-50ef-adb7-4a5708e9e381" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337178 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t)" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337178 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337178 1111 #uuid "6a30e35d-2f18-568c-a53a-471440599ccf" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337179 1034 "-2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337179 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337179 1111 #uuid "ef9ad601-25bd-5fda-aab5-3e898ea0b929" 13194139535201 true