}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}s} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+s}\\cdot 2s-\\frac{{s}^{2}}{(1+s)^{2}}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{2s}{1+s}-\\frac{{s}^{2}}{(1+s)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2s(1+s)-{s}^{2}}{(1+s)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{s(2+s)}{(1+s)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337212 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337213 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337214 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337215 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337216 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1041 "selection" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337216 13194139535201 true] [17592186337211 1110 #uuid "65e96526-11a1-5b2f-835a-502b26e3516d" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337212 1034 "\\frac{{s}^{2}(2+s)}{(1+s)}" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337212 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337212 1111 #uuid "4cdb55c8-1243-554f-b520-e69d644161aa" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337213 1034 "\\frac{1+{s}^{2}}{(1+s)^{2}}" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337213 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337213 1111 #uuid "7857d0b9-0cd0-588a-959a-10820aba4848" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337214 1034 "\\frac{s(1-s)}{(1+s)^{2}}" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337214 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337214 1111 #uuid "4f46db96-272e-51b2-9ffa-a69352b5332d" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337215 1034 "\\frac{2+{s}^{2}}{1+s}" 13194139535201 true] [17592186337215 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535201 true] [17592186337215 1111 #uuid "9c4bb290-4691-53d6-828c-575cd0f3a2b6" 1319413953